{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":146,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܗܲܠܸܠܘܼܝܵܐ، ܫܲܒܸܚܝ، ܝܵܐ ܓܵܢܝܼ، ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܫܲܒܚܸܢ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܒܚܲܝܝܼ̈،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܙܵܡܪܹܢ ܠܐܲܠܵܗ‌ܝܼ ܟܡܵܐ ܕܝܼܘܸܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܵܐ ܣܵܒܪܝܼܬܘܿܢ ܒܢܲܨܝܼܚܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܒܲܪܢܵܫܵܐ ܕܠܲܝܬ ܒܐܝܼܕܹܗ ܦܘܼܪܩܵܢܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܦܵܠܛܵܐ ܪܘܼܚܹܗ، ܟܹܐ ܕܵܐܹܪ ܠܥܲܦܪܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܘ ܝܵܘܡܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܛܵܠܩܝܼ ܚܘܼܫܵܒ݂ܘܼ̈ܗ‌ܝ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܛܘܼܒ݂ܵܐ ܠܡ̇ܢ ܕܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܕܝܲܥܩܘܿܒ݂ ܝܼܠܹܗ ܠܗܲܝܲܪܬܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܣܲܒ݂ܪܹܗ ܥܲܠܔ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܹܗ،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܵܒ݂ܕܵܢܵܐ ܕܫܡܲܝܵܐ ܘܐܲܪܥܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܡܵܐ ܘܟܠܔ ܕܐܝܼܬ ܓܵܘܵܝܗ‌ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܢܵܛܪܵܢܵܐ ܕܫܪܵܪܵܐ ܠܥܵܠܲܡ،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܵܒ݂ܕܵܢܵܐ ܕܕܝܼܘܵܢ ܕܛܠܝܼܡܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܗܒ݂ܵܢܵܐ ܕܠܲܚܡܵܐ ܠܟܦܝܼܢܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܫܵܪܝܵܢܵܐ ܕܐܲܣܝܼܪܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܦܵܬܚܵܢܵܐ ܕܥܲܝ̈ܢܹܐ ܕܣܸܡܝܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܡܲܪܡܵܢܵܐ ܕܛܥܝܼ̈ܦܹܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܡܲܚܸܒܵܢܵܐ ܕܙܲܕܝܼܩܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܢܵܛܪܵܢܵܐ ܕܡܵܫܵܚܲܛܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܢܕܵܢܵܐ ܕܝܲܬܘܼܡܹ̈ܐ ܘܐܲܪ̈ܡܸܠܝܵܬܹ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܐܘܼܪܚܵܐ ܕܪ̈ܲܫܝܼܥܹܐ ܟܹܐ ܡܲܦܟ̰ܸܠܔ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܥܵܒܹܕ ܡܲܠܟܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܠܥܵܠܲܡ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܠܵܗܵܟ݂ܝ، ܝܵܐ ܨܸܗܝܘܿܢ، ܠܕܵܪܵܐ ܘܕܵܪܵܐ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/146.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/147.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/145.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}